..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name        : TRANS.SET.VALUES.DICAREA
.. Autor           : fwester
.. Verantwortlich  : fwester
.. Kontrolle       : cl
.. Funktion        : Simuliert Radio button group fuer die Woerterbuchbereichsauswahl.
.. Ablauf          : Feldaustritts-EFOP
..
.. Functionality   : Simulates a radio button group for selection of an area of a dictionary.
.. Program flow    : Field exit efop
...Includes        :
.. include sy/TRANS.SET.PROTECT
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.copy M|optcomplete = G|evtvar = "optcomplete"
.copy M|optnottrans = G|evtvar = "optnottrans"
.copy M|optnumber = G|evtvar = "optnumber"
.copy M|opttrans = G|evtvar = "opttrans"
.copy M|optcorrupt = G|evtvar = "optcorrupt"
..
.. Will set protections and reset values below if a new area is selected
.continue END ? _F|empty(M|lastopt) & M|lastopt = G|evtvar
.formula M|lastopt = G|evtvar
.formula M|category = "OPTION2"
.input "sy/TRANS.SET.PROTECT"
..****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
